WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,390 --> 00:00:07,390
Liu Dabao, can you do it?

2
00:00:07,390 --> 00:00:08,390
Get out of my way

3
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:15,900
Someone is prying at the door

4
00:00:15,900 --> 00:00:22,090
Han Lu, there is someone at the stairs. Come out with weapons.

5
00:00:22,090 --> 00:00:24,090
I heard it too. Come right away.

6
00:00:24,090 --> 00:00:38,340
If you dare to mess with me, I'll teach you a lesson

7
00:00:42,520 --> 00:00:52,900
The other few ran away, and this is the only one left.

8
00:00:52,900 --> 00:00:55,900
Don't go out. Who knows if they have an ambush to close the door?
